%% Loan Completion Activity
flowchart TD
Start([Start]) --> N0[Repayment committed]
N0 --> N1[Compute outstanding balance]
N1 --> N2[Balance equals zero?]
N2 --> N3[Set loan COMPLETED and timestamp]
N3 --> N4[Record LOAN_COMPLETED event]
N4 --> N5[Show completed status]
N5 --> End([End])
V -- No --> Err[Reject invalid transition; no unauthorized mutation]
V -- Yes --> N1
